<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ELANTEC RAISED TO BUY.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ELANTEC RAISED TO BUY.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hambrecht &amp; Quist raised its rating on shares of Elantec Semiconductor Inc, a maker of high performance analog integrated circuits, to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- said stock has a favorable risk/reward profile.</p>
<p>-- said company is working on several new product families that could drive revenue growth.</p>
<p>-- set a price target of $8.00 per share on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Elantec shares were up 11/16 at 5-7/8.</p>
</text>
